<Project>
  <!--
    Deliberately empty, and deliberately present.

    MSBuild walks UP from each project looking for Directory.Build.props and stops at
    the first one it finds. Without this file the walk would reach the repository root
    and apply the harness's own settings to the fixture: TreatWarningsAsErrors,
    GenerateDocumentationFile and a pinned TargetFramework. The fixture would then fail
    to build over missing XML doc comments.

    The fixture's whole job is to be a plain, ordinary consumer repository, exactly like
    the repositories this tool is pointed at in the wild. This file is what keeps it one.
  -->
</Project>
